      "text": "This systematic review and meta-­ analysis was prospectively registered (PROSPERO CRD42022332009). Its results are presented as per the Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-­ Analysis (PRISMA) guidelines (Data S1). 29 We also followed et al . the synthesis without meta-­ analysis reporting guidelines to complement the PRISMA guidelines. 30",
