      "rerank_score_norm": 0.8341568486214626,
      "final_score": 0.7457045172814823,
      "text": "Data were extracted independently by two reviewers (JP and MM) using a standardized electronic sheet, and the conflicts were | resolved by consensus. Study authors were contacted when outcomes were incomplete or when ED patients were mixed in with other populations. Sample size, age range, inclusion/exclusion criteria, type of opioid, type of nonopioid analgesic, outcomes, and primary and secondary results were extracted.",
